WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.187
(drumming)

00:00:02.187 --> 00:00:04.237
(whooshing and creaking)
(drumming)

00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:08.919
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:15.563
- I've never dyed my hair.

00:00:15.563 --> 00:00:16.605
I have no dying in to my hair

00:00:16.605 --> 00:00:18.326
so we'll see what it's about.

00:00:18.326 --> 00:00:21.008
- I'm not very nervous. Not very excited.

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:22.363
Afraid it's gonna hurt.

00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:24.059
Just feels like my head's being painted.

00:00:24.059 --> 00:00:26.519
- [Girl] I really hope
my hair doesn't fall out

00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:28.462
'cause I super bleach it at home

00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:31.360
but I have really great
expectations for this.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.106
Like, I can't wait to have gray hair.

00:00:33.106 --> 00:00:34.285
- I feel great right because I have

00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:35.405
these nice ladies distracting me

00:00:35.405 --> 00:00:36.368
from the fact
(ladies laugh)

00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:37.804
that I'm bleaching my hair.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.667
I'm going for, like Disney villain.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.582
So, I have pretty high expectations.

00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:44.205
- I don't have my glasses on
so I can't really see myself

00:00:44.205 --> 00:00:45.842
but what I can see
(woman laughs)

00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:47.700
I feel, like, I was like Cisco.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.708
- I can see it going kind of blond.

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:53.234
- In order to go gray you
need to lift their hair

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:55.916
to the lightest yellow blond possible.

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:58.578
No way possible you get
it that late in one shot.

00:00:58.578 --> 00:00:59.182
- Well, I just found out we're doing

00:00:59.182 --> 00:01:01.747
round two of the bleaching so (laughs).

00:01:01.747 --> 00:01:04.383
- It feels like Play-Doh in a plastic bag.

00:01:04.383 --> 00:01:05.854
- It's looks pretty crazy right now.

00:01:05.854 --> 00:01:08.561
- Well, the liner does strip
the hair from everything

00:01:08.561 --> 00:01:09.340
- Mm-hm.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.304
- that was in the hair strand

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:10.476
but the
- Yeah.

00:01:10.476 --> 00:01:13.712
- b3 that we put in
the color helps deposit

00:01:13.712 --> 00:01:15.690
proteins, conditioning agents.

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:17.685
So, even though we're
stripping out pigment

00:01:17.685 --> 00:01:19.776
we're still adding in proteins and things

00:01:19.776 --> 00:01:20.904
to keep your hair strong.

00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:23.280
(upbeat music)

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.207
- I think I'm tearing up. It burns so bad.

00:01:25.207 --> 00:01:27.043
- I'm feelin' pretty good right now.

00:01:27.043 --> 00:01:29.224
So, I'm not crying like Leo.

00:01:29.224 --> 00:01:31.851
- Feel like a practical joke right now.

00:01:31.851 --> 00:01:32.422
- Three rounds of bleach.

00:01:32.422 --> 00:01:33.280
- [Stylist] Three rounds of bleach.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.554
- I feel the need to apologize

00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:36.078
for how labor intensive it is.

00:01:36.078 --> 00:01:38.072
- I thought it was gonna be way easier.

00:01:38.072 --> 00:01:40.128
Kinda like a one two and go.

00:01:40.128 --> 00:01:43.717
But no, we've been here for, I
think, like, three hours now?

00:01:43.717 --> 00:01:44.913
- [Girl] Finally putting in the gray.

00:01:44.913 --> 00:01:46.271
Oh, I don't know where I am right now.

00:01:46.271 --> 00:01:47.789
So many chemicals right now.

00:01:47.789 --> 00:01:49.310
- I'm really excited.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:51.288
I mean, this was just the steps.

00:01:51.288 --> 00:01:51.681
So, I don't know.

00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:53.120
You don't know until it's all done.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.411
- This part's the most surreal.

00:01:55.411 --> 00:01:57.651
The getting my hair cut and just having

00:01:57.651 --> 00:02:01.328
the hair falling off
green-gray is super strange.

00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:02.389
- [Leo] I mean, to think about the fact

00:02:02.389 --> 00:02:04.545
that just when I came in my hair was black

00:02:04.545 --> 00:02:05.671
and now it is gray.

00:02:05.671 --> 00:02:08.271
It's kind of impressive because
it's almost, like, magic.

00:02:08.271 --> 00:02:11.186
- I was a super light-haired girl

00:02:11.186 --> 00:02:13.592
so it's easier for them
but I couldn't imagine

00:02:13.592 --> 00:02:15.692
what it's like for a dark haired person.

00:02:15.692 --> 00:02:16.180
- [Girl] I have had thoughts about

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.636
whether this is, like, some
senior cultural appropriation.

00:02:19.636 --> 00:02:21.771
- I love it.

00:02:22.896 --> 00:02:23.476
- No.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.603
- [Voiceover] With your glasses on?

00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:26.791
Woah.

00:02:26.791 --> 00:02:29.128
(laughs)

00:02:29.128 --> 00:02:30.975
- [Voiceover] Look at that smile.

00:02:30.975 --> 00:02:32.821
- That's crazy.

00:02:32.821 --> 00:02:35.224
- I'm ready to take this
granny hair to the world.

00:02:35.224 --> 00:02:37.535
Show some whipper snappers how it's done.

00:02:37.535 --> 00:02:38.619
- And really well done.

00:02:38.619 --> 00:02:43.136
My hair feels healthier
than before I came in.

00:02:43.136 --> 00:02:45.495
So, it's great.

00:02:45.495 --> 00:02:47.933
- I'm a fan. It's definitely different

00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:49.896
and I don't know if I would, like

00:02:49.896 --> 00:02:52.133
do it again because it takes so much,

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:53.578
such a long time to do it

00:02:53.578 --> 00:02:56.858
so I definitely appreciate
what it actually is for fun

00:02:56.858 --> 00:02:58.254
or for any reason.

00:02:58.254 --> 00:02:59.718
- It was fun.

00:02:59.718 --> 00:03:03.103
It felt like I was getting
my hair washed for,

00:03:03.103 --> 00:03:05.945
like, four hours straight. I'm into it.

00:03:05.945 --> 00:03:07.330
- But damn, do I look good.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.067
I'm sorry, I love it.

00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:10.658
Robin did an amazing job.

00:03:10.658 --> 00:03:12.504
I feel like I have a
whole life ahead of me

00:03:12.504 --> 00:03:14.223
even though I look kinda 80.

00:03:14.223 --> 00:03:18.149
(gentle music)

00:03:24.089 --> 00:03:26.757
(whooshing and creaking)

